  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/q7nern2dqtkI7PZrAppjiSfP1xjtyUi3EQmklBy1FsU.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\r\n\r\n$\\text { At } \\mathrm{P}, \\Delta x=\\frac{(8 d) \\times 3 d}{\\mathrm{D}}$\r\n\r\nFor 2 nd maxima, $\\Delta x=2 \\lambda$\r\n\r\n$\\begin{array}{l}\r\n\r\n\\Rightarrow \\frac{24 d^{2}}{\\mathrm{D}}=2 \\lambda \\\\\r\n\r\n\\Rightarrow \\lambda=\\frac{12 d^{2}}{\\mathrm{D}}\r\n\r\n\\end{array}$",
